<style>
  .si-everflow-teaser {
    background: #fdf8e2;
    color: #610a1e;
    font-family: var(--si-sans, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif);
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* ── Top gradient accent ── */
  .si-ef-accent {
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      var(--si-burg-deep, #610a1e),
      var(--si-gold, #d4b896),
      var(--si-burg-deep, #610a1e)
    );
    opacity: 0.45;
  }

  /* ── Main content wrapper ── */
  .si-ef-content {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 5rem 2rem 6rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* ── Title ── */
  .si-ef-title {
    font-family: var(--si-serif, 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif);
    font-size: 56px;
    line-height: 1.12;
    color: #610a1e;
    text-transform: capitalize;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  /* ── Teaser label ── */
  .si-ef-label {
    font-size: 30px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: rgba(97, 10, 30, 0.5);
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  /* ── Book cover image ── */
  .si-ef-image-wrap {
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    max-width: 400px;
  }
  .si-ef-image-wrap img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 2px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  /* ── Divider ── */
  .si-ef-divider {
    width: 60px;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--si-gold, #d4b896), transparent);
    margin: 2.5rem auto;
  }

  /* ── Body text paragraphs ── */
  .si-ef-body {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .si-ef-body strong {
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* ── Italic / emphasis blocks ── */
  .si-ef-emphasis {
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #000;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  /* ── Character profiles ── */
  .si-ef-characters {
    margin: 3rem 0;
    text-align: left;
    max-width: 620px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .si-ef-character {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(212, 184, 150, 0.3);
  }
  .si-ef-character-name {
    font-family: var(--si-serif, 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif);
    font-size: 22px;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .si-ef-character-name span {
    color: #000;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  /* Element colors removed as per request for all black text */
  /* .si-ef-character-element-fire .si-ef-character-name span { color: #e8834a; }
  .si-ef-character-element-earth .si-ef-character-name span { color: #8faa6b; }
  .si-ef-character-element-air .si-ef-character-name span { color: #b0c4de; }
  .si-ef-character-element-water .si-ef-character-name span { color: #5b9bd5; } */

  .si-ef-character-element-fire {
    border-left-color: rgba(232, 131, 74, 0.4);
  }
  .si-ef-character-element-earth {
    border-left-color: rgba(143, 170, 107, 0.4);
  }
  .si-ef-character-element-air {
    border-left-color: rgba(176, 196, 222, 0.4);
  }
  .si-ef-character-element-water {
    border-left-color: rgba(91, 155, 213, 0.4);
  }

  .si-ef-character p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  /* ── Closing ── */
  .si-ef-closing {
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }
  .si-ef-closing p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .si-ef-closing .si-ef-final {
    font-family: var(--si-serif, 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #000;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ── */
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .si-ef-title {
      font-size: 36px;
    }
    .si-ef-label {
      font-size: 22px;
    }
    .si-ef-content {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    }
    .si-ef-image-wrap {
      max-width: 300px;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class='si-everflow-teaser'>
  <div class='si-ef-accent'></div>
  <div class='si-ef-content'>
    <!-- Title -->
    <h1 class='si-ef-title'>{{ section.settings.title | default: 'The Balance-Born Saga - Year 1' }}</h1>

    <!-- Teaser label -->
    <p class='si-ef-label'>{{ section.settings.label | default: 'TEASER' }}</p>

    <!-- Book cover image -->
    <div class='si-ef-image-wrap'>
      {% if section.settings.image != blank %}
        <img
          src='{{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 800 }}'
          alt='{{ section.settings.title | strip_html | escape }}'
        >
      {% elsif section.settings.image_asset != blank %}
        <img
          src='{{ section.settings.image_asset | asset_url }}'
          alt='{{ section.settings.title | strip_html | escape }}'
        >
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class='si-ef-divider'></div>

    <!-- Opening hook -->
    <p class='si-ef-emphasis'>
      Four students.<br>
      Four elements.<br>
      One fragile balance.<br>
      Everflow was meant to train them.<br>
      Instead, it might destroy them.<br>
      Because when the elements awaken…<br>
      the truth rises with them.
    </p>

    <div class='si-ef-divider'></div>

    <!-- Synopsis block 1 -->
    <p class='si-ef-body'>
      Four elements.<br>
      One hidden power.<br>
      A balance the world has forgotten.
    </p>
    <p class='si-ef-body'>
      A group of teenagers arrive at the Government mandated training facility known as Everflow.
    </p>
    <p class='si-ef-body'>
      <strong>Earth. Air. Fire. Water.</strong>
    </p>
    <p class='si-ef-body'>But power is never given without purpose.</p>
    <p class='si-ef-body'>
      As their abilities awaken, so do secrets buried deep within Everflow's walls. The truth about the elements and the
      balance they were meant to protect—may be far more dangerous than anyone imagined.
    </p>
    <p class='si-ef-body'>
      Because some forces were never meant to be controlled.<br>
      And some truths were never meant to surface.
    </p>

    <p class='si-ef-emphasis'>The elements are rising.</p>

    <div class='si-ef-divider'></div>

    <!-- Synopsis block 2 -->
    <p class='si-ef-body'>At Everflow, they tell you the elements are gifts.</p>
    <p class='si-ef-body'>
      Earth steadies.<br>
      Air lifts.<br>
      Fire ignites.<br>
      Water endures.
    </p>
    <p class='si-ef-body'>But gifts can also be weapons.</p>
    <p class='si-ef-body'>
      When four students begin to uncover the truth behind their powers, they realise<br>
      Everflow is hiding more than just secrets—it's hiding the cost of balance.
    </p>
    <p class='si-ef-emphasis'>
      And once the elements awaken…<br>
      there may be no way to stop them.
    </p>

    <div class='si-ef-divider'></div>

    <!-- Synopsis block 3 -->
    <p class='si-ef-body'>
      At Everflow, power is not chosen.<br>
      It awakens.<br>
      And when it does, balance is everything.
    </p>

    <div class='si-ef-divider'></div>

    <!-- Character profiles -->
    <div class='si-ef-characters'>
      <div class='si-ef-character si-ef-character-element-fire'>
        <p class='si-ef-character-name'>Aurelia — <span>Fire</span></p>
        <p>
          Fierce, determined, and impossible to ignore, Aurelia's power burns bright and dangerous. Fire answers her
          emotions, but controlling it may mean confronting the truth about who she really is.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class='si-ef-character si-ef-character-element-earth'>
        <p class='si-ef-character-name'>Raith — <span>Earth</span></p>
        <p>
          Strong, steady, and built like the foundations of the world itself, Raith believes in structure and loyalty.
          But when the ground beneath Everflow begins to shift, he must decide what truly deserves his strength.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class='si-ef-character si-ef-character-element-air'>
        <p class='si-ef-character-name'>Sage — <span>Air</span></p>
        <p>
          Quick-minded and endlessly curious, Sage moves like the wind—restless and searching. Yet some truths carried
          on the air were never meant to be heard.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class='si-ef-character si-ef-character-element-water'>
        <p class='si-ef-character-name'>Elias — <span>Water</span></p>
        <p>
          Quiet, watchful, and deeply intuitive, Elias feels the currents others miss. Water remembers everything… and
          some memories refuse to stay buried.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class='si-ef-divider'></div>

    <!-- Closing -->
    <div class='si-ef-closing'>
      <p>Together they were brought to Everflow to learn control.</p>
      <p>But as their powers grow, so do the secrets surrounding them.</p>
      <br>
      <p>Because the elements were never meant to be ruled.</p>
      <br>
      <p>They were meant to remain in balance.</p>
      <br>
      <p class='si-ef-final'>And that balance… is beginning to break.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class='si-ef-accent'></div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "SI Everflow Teaser",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Title", "default": "The Balance-Born Saga - Year 1" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Teaser label", "default": "TEASER" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Book cover image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "image_asset", "label": "Image asset filename", "default": "coming-soon-jessie-heart.png" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "SI Everflow Teaser" }]
}
{% endschema %}
